Bind Npc 13009 Zone 21
Quest 88 "Gemstone of Courage"
    Journal "I must bring [Mercenary Captain] Cougar the Gemstone of Courage and receive a reward."
    Collect 10 of 910039000

Requires player level >= 21

Rewards
    Give 150000 experience
    Choose one
        Give 1 of 202001006
        Give 1 of 242001006
        Give 1 of 262001006
        Give 1 of 282001006

On available
    Say "Master, I heard the mercenary captain is preparing a training evaluation. Let's go see him."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "I think the time has come to test how much you've grown."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Don't feel obligated. It's not a difficult exam. Catch the Smirdon inside the stadium and bring back 10 Dragon Jewels. Isn't it a piece of cake?\n\nYou will pass the test if you catch the Smirdon in the arena where Mercenary Captain Cougar sends you and bring back 10 Dragon Jewels to him."

On in_progress
    Say "You're short on Dragon Jewels. Are you going to go back to the stadium?"

On ready
    Say "Master, all the Dragon Jewels have been collected. Let's talk to the stadium manager and get out of here."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Good. You're all right. I should give you an appropriate award for passing the test."
